        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A japanese visual novel.\n\nArcana Famiglia is a self-appointed organization whose members have mysterious powers. They use these powers to protect a small Mediterranean island, Regalo, from pirates, foreign countries, and other threats. The members are all extremely loyal and devoted to the Family's leaders, being: Mondo, the boss, Sumire, his wife, and Felicità, the daughter and main heroine. The story is focused on the only daughter of the \"Papà\": Felicità, will be married to the next head of the family in two months — and the successor will be decided in a competition that Felicità herself will take part in.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Una novela visual japonesa.\n\nArcana Famiglia es una organización autoproclamada cuyos miembros poseen poderes misteriosos. Usan estos poderes para proteger una pequeña isla del Mediterráneo, Regalo, de piratas, países extranjeros y otras amenazas. Los miembros son extremadamente leales y devotos a los líderes de la Familia: Mondo, el jefe; Sumire, su esposa; y Felicità, la hija y heroína principal. La historia se centra en la única hija del «Papà»: Felicità se casará con el próximo líder de la familia dentro de dos meses, y el sucesor se decidirá en una competición en la que la propia Felicità participará.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2011",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
